DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
RunAsDaemon 0
SocksPort 0
ControlPort 0
ORPort 0
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
ClientOnly 1
ClientUseIPv6 0
SafeLogging 1
Log notice stdout
MaxMemInQueues 64 MB
BandwidthRate 1 MB
BandwidthBurst 2 MB
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/binternet
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 unix:/run/onion/http.sock
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 32
HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSRatePerSec 5
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSBurstPerSec 20
